    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 Bed Detached Residence and Garage\r\n\r\nThis Home is presented in excellent condition throughout and stands on a South facing elevated site.\r\n\r\nLocated just 2 minutes from Rosscarbery Town Centre with its Schools, Shops, Restaurants, Medical Centre, Pharmacy, and is within 5 minutes’ drive of the Warren Beach. \r\n\r\nThis Home has the benefit of a mature lawned Garden to the front and sides, also having the benefit of a secluded Paved Patio area to the rear. \r\n\r\nCork Airport – 45 Minutes, \tClonakilty & Skibbereen – 15 Minutes. \r\n\r\nServices: Mains Water, Private Drainage, Electricity, OFCH, Fibre Broadband\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      },
